    "Export a restorable JSON manifest, a ZIP with original evidence, a CSV spreadsheet, or a PDF evidence report. Every restore shows a preview first. Merge updates matching orders; Replace requires a separate destructive confirmation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Export a restorable JSON manifest, a ZIP with original evidence, a CSV spreadsheet, or a PDF evidence report. Every restore shows a preview first. Merge updates matching orders; Replace requires a separate destructive confirmation."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可导出可恢复的 JSON 清单、包含原始证据的 ZIP、CSV 表格或 PDF 证据报告。每次恢复前都会显示预览；合并会更新匹配订单，替换则需要单独确认破坏性操作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Orders, evidence, and preferences are stored locally on this iPhone. Keyvow has no account system, analytics, advertising trackers, or developer backend. Nothing is shared unless you choose an export; App Store purchases are handled by Apple.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Orders, evidence, and preferences are stored locally on this iPhone. Keyvow has no account system, analytics, advertising trackers, or developer backend. Nothing is shared unless you choose an export; App Store purchases are handled by Apple."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "订单、证据和偏好设置均保存在此 iPhone 本地。键诺没有账户系统、分析工具、广告跟踪器或开发者后端。除非你主动导出，否则不会分享任何内容；App Store 购买由 Apple 处理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Evidence files live in Keyvow’s Application Support evidence folder with iOS file protection. Exports are created in temporary storage and leave the app only through your share-sheet action.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Evidence files live in Keyvow’s Application Support evidence folder with iOS file protection. Exports are created in temporary storage and leave the app only through your share-sheet action."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "证据文件保存在键诺的 Application Support 证据文件夹中，并受 iOS 文件保护。导出文件创建于临时存储，只有你通过分享面板操作时才会离开应用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
